#: content/guides.ts
msgid "A clipping run costs the vendor real money: transcription minutes, a language-model call to pick moments, face detection and a video render. A free plan that produced clean clips would lose money on every user who never converts. So free plans do one or more of: watermark the output, cap the minutes, lower the resolution, or delete the clips after a few days."
msgstr "A clipping run costs the vendor real money: transcription minutes, a language-model call to pick moments, face detection and a video render. A free plan that produced clean clips would lose money on every user who never converts. So free plans do one or more of: watermark the output, cap the minutes, lower the resolution, or delete the clips after a few days."

