msgid "A real editor: multi-lane timeline, frame-accurate trims, layout sections, layers, layer templates, fades and crossfades, intros and outros, undo."
msgstr "A real editor: multi-lane timeline, frame-accurate trims, layout sections, layers, layer templates, fades and crossfades, intros and outros, undo."

#: content/use-cases.ts
msgid "A setup and a payoff inside 60 seconds: the selector scores each candidate on hook, value, flow and shareability, and drops weak picks relative to the rest of the stream rather than filling a quota."
