#: content/legal.ts
msgid "Your account"
msgstr "Your account"

#: content/legal.ts
msgid "Your decisions: the fixes you accept, reject or make and the clips you edit, create or delete, each with the transcript words or clip text it was about (a few dozen words around a fix, the text of a clip), which models proposed it, and the source's title, link and fingerprint. We use them only to improve what the Service suggests to you (a few of your past rejections are shown to the model checking your next video) and to measure the Service against real choices. We do not sell them or use them for advertising, and model providers do not train on them. Turning off Settings → Learning stops recording; nothing is recorded while it is off."
msgstr "Your decisions: the fixes you accept, reject or make and the clips you edit, create or delete, each with the transcript words or clip text it was about (a few dozen words around a fix, the text of a clip), which models proposed it, and the source's title, link and fingerprint. We use them only to improve what the Service suggests to you (a few of your past rejections are shown to the model checking your next video) and to measure the Service against real choices. We do not sell them or use them for advertising, and model providers do not train on them. Turning off Settings → Learning stops recording; nothing is recorded while it is off."

